<Base lang="en" alternatePath="/waribashi/" title="Waribashi - Chopsticks Battle — Meowtaverse Games" description="Add fingers, split them, and plan your next move in a turn-based strategy game. Play Waribashi - Chopsticks Battle in local, CPU, and online modes.">
  <article class="max-w-3xl">
    <p class="eyebrow mb-4">WARIBASHI / CHOPSTICKS</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl leading-tight font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Waribashi - Chopsticks Battle</h1>
    <p class="mt-5 text-xl font-medium">Simple rules. A thoughtful next move.</p>
    <p class="mt-6 text-slate-600">Waribashi (Chopsticks) is a turn-based finger strategy game. Start with one finger on each hand. Attack to add fingers to your opponent’s hand, or split to redistribute your own. Under the standard rules, a hand with five or more fingers is out. Eliminate both of your opponent’s hands to win.</p>
    <section class="mt-8 rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 ring-1 ring-ink/10 sm:p-8" aria-labelledby="modes-heading">
      <h2 id="modes-heading" class="text-lg font-bold">Play your way.</h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-slate-600">
        <li>Local Battle: play with a friend on one device</li>
        <li>CPU Battle: challenge the CPU across four difficulty levels</li>
        <li>Online Battle: play against people around the world in real time</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-slate-600">Includes rule variations, a tutorial, and support for English and Japanese.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="mt-10">
      <a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/id6760738303" class="button">View on the App Store</a>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-500">Android version coming soon</p>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Related Waribashi pages" class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-3 border-t border-ink/10 pt-6 text-sm">
      <a href="/en/waribashi/privacy/" class="text-link">Privacy policy</a>
      <a href="/en/waribashi/support/" class="text-link">Support</a>
    </nav>
  </article>
</Base>
